{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-4","storyName":"求道","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"能天使发现育婴圣堂住满了无辜的难民，她不得不拆除自己的炸弹，并意外遇到了前来调查的蕾缪安。与此同时，费德里科找到了阿尔图罗，但二人似乎都注意到了拉特兰的异样。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["帕特里奇昂","薇尔丽芙","能天使","？？？","蕾缪安","费德里科","阿尔图罗","席德佳"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_bg_26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"......","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"您为什么要用这样别扭的姿势靠墙站着？我还以为自己看见了一尊雕塑......","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"你要是进来得早一些，就能听见我的关节咔咔响了，哈哈。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"看来得抽空去找一趟工匠师傅，看能不能在腰间加装一块护枕......","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"铳骑装甲的设计师估计不会考虑这种关爱老年人的特殊设计......","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"这主要是为了缓冲巨铳的后坐力嘛，年轻的铳骑也需要！","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"降生仪式可就在明天了，育婴圣堂那边准备得怎么样了？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"那位母亲状态很稳定，安多恩将她照顾得相当好，相信明天她会诞下一位健康且美丽的新生儿。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"维什戴尔议长和卡兹戴尔使节团、双子女皇和莱塔尼亚使节团、阿戈尔发展规划所执政官代表团、炎国宣礼使带领的天师团......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"明天，所有到访圣城的客人都会受邀前往育婴圣堂，共同见证那个新生命的降生。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"不过，既然一切正常，你今天找我是为了？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"我们的新人枢机......","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"蕾缪安？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"她专程去见了一趟牧首。我想——","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"她应该不是在调查爆炸事件时“偶然”经过，“顺便”看看，再“心血来潮”地提出以第七厅的名义为育婴圣堂提供帮助吧？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"我起初以为她是为安多恩遇袭的事来的。但她见过牧首之后的表现......很明显她还有更多疑虑。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"我还以为我已经打消了她的疑虑。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"蕾缪安的敏锐很多时候无人能及，尤其在她关注某件事的时候。我很想说，她确实就是最适合成为七厅枢机的那个人。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"但她同时也是不适合的。毕竟，她的注意力在哪，似乎大部分时候只取决于她自己的私人判断。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"哈哈。那你觉得有必要对她加以防范吗？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"......您这个语气，搞得好像我们是什么反派，正在酝酿颠覆拉特兰的大阴谋一样。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"难说哟。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"对于有些人来说，我们将要迎接的那个未来，恐怕确实会颠覆他们所知的生活。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"我们的共感，我们的同胞与亲族，甚至“萨科塔”这一概念本身......都将抛却旧有的局限。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"这本是拉特兰所行之道既定的终点，但这道路毕竟绵延了太长、太久。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"或许有些人反倒将过程中伴生的一些微不足道的意外现象当作了常态，以至于无法接受原本既定的终点。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"说得也是。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"我们还是应该早做准备。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"蕾缪安的事情，我会处理。你就回到育婴圣堂，专心准备明天的仪式吧。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"愿主继续赐福这座城。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_bg_61_g4_nurseryindoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":65},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":66,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":68},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_comfortbell","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.5","channel":"1","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"头发火红的萨科塔在苍白与幽蓝交织的丛林中东奔西走，像一撮小小的火苗在雨中摇曳。","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#10$1","duration":"1.5","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"那个安抚铃上的云朵快赶上可颂的面包车大了......还有那能塞下两个集装箱的摇篮......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_comfortbell","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.5","channel":"1","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"安抚铃上悬挂的云朵仿佛能遮蔽天光，托举摇篮的双手似乎又要耸入云霄。","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"在这圣堂之中，一切活物都显得渺小。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"嗯？","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"怎么会......","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":97},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1","duration":"1.5","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"看起来空荡荡的，安静得要死，但这些育婴室，起码有一半以上都住了人......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"小孩子、异族人，甚至还有堕天使......保育员忙来忙去，看样子他们应该已经住进来很久了。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"那帮人不是说这里绝大多数设施都还没有投入使用，要等到那个什么仪式办完之后才开放吗？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"压根不是那么回事！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-20","duration":"1.5","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"不行......得拆掉这些炸弹！","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,-20","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"本来以为先把场地炸掉，仪式就办不成了，结果这里面全是人......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"真要命啊，好不容易才躲开那些守卫安好的......","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tidyequipment","volume":"1","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#10$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,-20","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"......要是她们在就好了。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"可以拜托德克萨斯把守卫全部打晕拖到外面去，或者让可颂撞开那些房间，把里面的人统统打包带走......","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#5$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,-20","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"实在不行，这帮人办仪式的时候，就让老板在对面开一个粉丝见面会之类的，把注意力都吸引过去......","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tidyequipment","volume":"1","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#10$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,-20","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"算了，继续，没多少时间了。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"拆掉这些炸弹，再想别的办法——","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"none","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"先剪掉那根蓝色的线，拆起来会快很多哦。","id":131},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#6$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,-20","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"唔啊......","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"charslot","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"你什么时候回来的？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"小乐。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_bg_26_g10_laterano_roof.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":149},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":150,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"这栋住宅很普通，唯一的特点是天台的视野——恰好可以看清育婴圣堂前的广场。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"阿尔图罗，这是你选择躲藏在此的原因？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"又见面了呢。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"你找了过来，而且速度比想象中快了很多。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"你并没有想要隐藏自己的行迹。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"你用纸蜻蜓脱身，留下了太过明显的线索。在崔林特尔梅的时候，我不止一次见过你使用类似的音乐术式。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"唔，虽然很不愿意承认......","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"但你真的掌握了我的许多秘密，费迪。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"等等，你们......","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"席德佳修女，难道我们的执行者先生没有告诉你，我是他的姐姐吗？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5D/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"啊？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"你我的远亲关系，并不妨碍我作为执行者对你实施监视与管控。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"阿尔图罗，将你带回拉特兰之前，在崔林特尔梅的城外，我给予过你警告——","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"我会对你保持更高的警惕，审慎判断你行为的主观动机与可能导致的客观结果。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"如果发现任何可疑的地方，我会击毙你。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我还记得那天的晚霞。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"席德佳修女，他真是一个刻板到有趣的人，对吧？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5D/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"阿尔图罗小姐，一直以来，您都非常配合我们的工作。所以受监管期间，兰登修道院并没有太为难您。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"您欺骗了我们！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我深表歉意，席德佳修女。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"希望我的无礼行为不会给你、给兰登修道院带来不好的影响。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"阿尔图罗，交代你擅自离开兰登修道院的目的。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"看看这座圣堂，费迪。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"多么雄伟且富有生命力的建筑，它耸入云端，高度甚至远远超过了莱塔尼亚人引以为傲的女皇双塔......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"这是拉特兰试图为自己打造的“恩典”与“权威”？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"看看那些正被引入其中的、没有光环的异族人。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"拉特兰需要他们做什么？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"阿尔图罗，你究竟发现了什么？","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"回到拉特兰前，我们曾在罗德岛短暂停留，还记得吗？","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我在那里见到了一位神秘的客人。他告诉我，或许终有一日，拉特兰将不再是独属于萨科塔们的温馨小屋。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"费迪，还有席德佳修女，看看眼前的景象，你们难道不曾怀疑，这一天已经到来？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我们引以为傲的圣城，为何变了模样？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"这是，什、什么意思？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"费迪，从来都清醒的你，显然也察觉到了什么，不是吗？","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"否则，在见到我的第一秒，你就已经举起了铳。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":230},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":231,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那些是，炸弹？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"看起来威力可不小。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"老姐，你的腿已经完全恢复了？！","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"嗯啊。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"太好了！","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"小乐，我那天在约维塔街看到的，以及阿摩斯辅佐官在铳械工坊外看到的，都是你？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"教皇厅已经对爆炸物进行了相当严苛的管控，还能做出这么多炸弹......小乐，你这方面的本事还是那么好。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"嘿嘿。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"那么，小乐，你的目的是什么？","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"炸毁这座圣堂？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"阻止降生仪式？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"还是，破坏整个万国峰会？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"别过来，老姐。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AB/Avg_61_i07.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":261},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"65","block":"false","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"巨型立柱切割开了光影，蕾缪安停下脚步，没有继续走向能天使。","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"老姐，你这一身是枢机的制服吧？","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"好看吗？","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"很合身！超级帅气！","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"其实稍微有些大欸，上任前一天刚领到，我还连夜自己动手改了一下腰线呢。","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"唉，真不希望久别重逢是在穿着这身制服的场合。","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"小乐是一个人回来的吗？还是说有其他朋友陪着你，他们也在附近？","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哈哈，老姐你在套我的话欸！","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"小乐是个想法单纯的孩子嘛。这不是学校，也不是毕业典礼，小乐真的只是心血来潮想要用这样的方式助兴吗？","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"是谁在你身后，又为什么将你推到这个位置？","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我......","id":276},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"嘿——口令，“蛋黄酱苹果派！”","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"口令，“烤一块吃一块。”","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"呀，小时候的事情，老姐你居然还记得！","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"只要遇到吵不出结果的架，不愿意说的秘密，就赶紧喊口令暂停，把矛盾存起来。","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"小乐，姐姐能感受到你的情绪，纠结、急切、焦虑，甚至不知道该从何解释......","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"但将试图破坏万国峰会的危险分子捉拿归案，这是姐姐的职责所在。我也会向教皇厅申请亲自负责本案的后续审理。","id":285},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"萨科塔姐妹对峙着，两个人没有挪动脚步，也没有再说一句话。终于，蕾缪安忍不住打破了沉默，她长长地叹了一口气。","id":287},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"唉~","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.4","channel":"1","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"image","id":296},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"1","channel":"1","id":297},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":299},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":300,"musicid":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"几乎是在同一个瞬间，能天使扑了过来，将她抱紧。","id":303},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","duration":"1.5","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","duration":"1.5","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......这才是你每次惹祸了的第一反应啊。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"真想你啊，老姐！","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这么久没见，你好像长高了一点？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哈哈哈哈哪有！我离开拉特兰的时候都快成年了好吗！","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"老姐你这个口吻，就像那种很爱操心的家长的标准语气。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"哈哈哈，是这样吗？","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这辫子是你自己扎的吗？都松了。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我帮你重新扎一下......你还是这样马马虎虎的。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我的手艺当然没有你的好嘛。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"老姐，你今天为什么会来到这里？总不是知道我会出现吧？","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"只是来确认圣堂的安防......本以为见到牧首为一位萨卡兹孕妇祈祷就已经够特别了......","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"没想到又碰见了你。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"——","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"（牧首......萨卡兹孕妇......祈祷......）","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"（难道说，降生仪式就是......）","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哈哈，老姐，原来你也不那么清楚这座圣堂里有什么嘛！","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"你不会打算反过来套我的话吧，小乐？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这又是谁教给你的？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"老姐——我真的没有跟人学坏啦。现在支持我做这些事的人——我向你保证——是很可靠的！","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我没有孤军奋战，也没有被人利用哦。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"一切都很不对劲，但更具体的我很难向你说明......我还需要一点时间。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"做完该做的事情，我会回家的！","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"r","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"none","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪安挽好了头绳的最后一圈，又往上紧了紧，让妹妹脑侧的那束头发不至于那么容易松。","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.4","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#3$2","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#3$2","focus":"none","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"但下一个瞬间，她的怀抱已经空了。","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":364},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#3$2","focus":"none","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"剩下的这些炸弹，就麻烦枢机大人替我拆掉喽！","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"炸弹的倒计时声在多处同时响起，蕾缪安看着妹妹消失的方向，却没法继续追。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......真没办法啊。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":375},{"type":"image","id":376},{"type":"charslot","id":377}],"characters":["帕特里奇昂","薇尔丽芙","能天使","？？？","蕾缪安","费德里科","阿尔图罗","席德佳"]}